@startuml agent_collaboration
title Multi-Agent Collaboration Pattern - Task Delegation & Callback

skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam participantPadding 20
skinparam boxPadding 10

' Participants
box "Node 1" #LightGreen
    participant "Agent A\n(Feature Dev)" as A #PaleGreen
end box

box "Shared State" #LightYellow
    database "Object Store\n(Ray)" as OS
    queue "Task Queue" as Q
end box

box "Node 2" #LightCoral
    participant "Agent B\n(DevOps)" as B #LightPink
end box

' Main flow
== Phase 1: Agent A Working on Data Download Feature ==

A -> A : Running Claude Code\nImplementing data download

note right of A
  **Agent A's Task**
  Implement data download feature
  using Claude Code
end note

A -> A : Discover: Need containerization\nfor production deployment

== Phase 2: Task Delegation ==

A -> OS : **put(task_context)**\n- Current code state\n- Requirements\n- Callback reference
activate OS
OS --> A : task_ref (ObjectRef)
deactivate OS

A -> Q : **submit_task(task_ref)**\nDelegate to Agent B
activate Q

note over A, Q
  **Task Context Contains:**
  • Source code snapshot
  • Dockerfile requirements
  • Tests to pass
  • Callback: agent_a.on_containerization_done.remote()
end note

Q -> B : **dispatch task**
deactivate Q
activate B

A -> A : Continue other work\n(non-blocking)

note right of A #LightBlue
  Agent A doesn't block.
  Can work on other
  parts of the feature.
end note

== Phase 3: Agent B Working ==

B -> OS : **get(task_ref)**\nFetch task context
activate OS
OS --> B : task_context
deactivate OS

B -> B : Running Claude Code\nImplementing containerization

note left of B
  **Agent B's Work**
  • Create Dockerfile
  • Configure docker-compose
  • Add CI/CD pipeline
  • Write container tests
end note

B -> B : Test container locally
B -> B : Verify all tests pass

== Phase 4: Completion & Callback ==

B -> OS : **put(result)**\n- Dockerfile\n- docker-compose.yml\n- Updated code
activate OS
OS --> B : result_ref
deactivate OS

B -> A : **agent_a.on_containerization_done.remote(result_ref)**\nCallback with result
activate A
deactivate B

note over B, A #LightGreen
  **Callback Pattern**
  Agent B notifies Agent A
  by calling A's method
  with the result reference
end note

A -> OS : **get(result_ref)**
activate OS
OS --> A : containerization_result
deactivate OS

A -> A : Integrate containerization\ninto feature branch

A -> A : Continue feature development\nwith containerized code

== Result ==

note over A
  **Final State**
  Agent A has:
  ✓ Data download feature
  ✓ Containerization (from B)
  ✓ Ready for deployment
end note

@enduml
